From: Brady <brady@aioscilloscope.com>
Subject: ax88179_178a: support for the AX88179A/B, AX88772D/E and AX88279 (backport of the AX88179A series' patches 3-12 to 6.12)
Copyright (C) 2026 Olympian LED, Inc.

The ASIX AX88179A and AX88179B USB gigabit Ethernet chips (and their 100
Mbit and 2.5 Gbit siblings AX88772D/E and AX88279) are now driven in their
own vendor mode by the ax88179_178a driver, with the link read from the PHY,
checksum and segmentation offload, VLAN offload, pause frames and EEPROM
access. This is a backport of the driver series under review upstream.
Upstream code by Birger Koblitz, under review on netdev (not merged yet);
the file headers keep their copyright notices.

---
diff --git a/drivers/net/usb/Kconfig b/drivers/net/usb/Kconfig
index 73498a3..0c14682 100644
--- a/drivers/net/usb/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/net/usb/Kconfig
@@ -198,10 +198,11 @@ config USB_NET_AX8817X
 	  what other networking devices you have in use.
 
 config USB_NET_AX88179_178A
-	tristate "ASIX AX88179/178A USB 3.0/2.0 to Gigabit Ethernet"
+	tristate "ASIX AX88179/179A/178A USB 2.0/3.0 to 100M/1G/2.5GbE Adapters"
 	depends on USB_USBNET
+	select PHYLINK
+	select AX88796B_PHY
 	select CRC32
-	select PHYLIB
 	default y
 	help
 	  This option adds support for ASIX AX88179 based USB 3.0/2.0
@@ -209,6 +210,9 @@ config USB_NET_AX88179_178A
 
 	  This driver should work with at least the following devices:
 	    * ASIX AX88179
+	    * ASIX AX88179A/B
+	    * ASIX AX88279
+	    * ASIX AX88772D/E
 	    * ASIX AX88178A
 	    * Sitcomm LN-032
 
